ZEROLLAMA_KV_COW=1 forks shared llama_kv_cells_vec.
ZEROLLAMA_KV_COW_TENSORS=1 allocates private K/V and copies from donor.
ZEROLLAMA_KV_COW_PAGES=1 copies only used cell ranges (v_trans-aware);
falls back to full copy at >=80% density. VRAM still full-size.
